			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a50" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts98" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts99">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>No he would take things though that would specifically create some kind of effect He was a very definitely a sensualist and went out but that might have been earlier than So now you were going to ask a question Have you heard the story of Pressberger and the thesis that he didn't that the PhD that he didn't get from Turism?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
